{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_98ecda8dd7f2280a-470\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>張國強（KK）入行多年人緣甚佳，日前他現身支持譚詠麟（校長）的演唱會，而他當日還巧遇昔日一起主持《430穿梭機》的舊拍檔曾華倩！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_98ecda8dd7f2280a-470\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"68b46dc6-a231-4994-86c0-b2ac6dac0b9e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20266w03ybhmYc1789982259.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"68b46dc6-a231-4994-86c0-b2ac6dac0b9e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_98ecda8dd7f2280a-471\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>張國強與曾華倩當年同為 TVB 兒童節目《430穿梭機》的第一代主持人。相中可見，久違露面的曾華倩頭戴鴨舌帽配搭綠色針織背心現身，張國強則搭著她的肩膀，二人笑容燦爛，狀態都非常好。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_98ecda8dd7f2280a-471\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"87fc8549-1d0c-421e-ae60-c20e14d5db49.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026N7hTTIKKvF1789982259.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"87fc8549-1d0c-421e-ae60-c20e14d5db49.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_98ecda8dd7f2280a-472\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>這張難得的合照亦瞬間勾起網民們的集體回憶，紛紛留言大讚：「係喎！你哋以前都係《430穿梭機》嘅人」、「過咗咁多年兩位都保養得好好」、「由細睇到大」、「好掛住你哋呀！」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T09:58:38.745784+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}